// $1ABC870: [32-bit] Car Upgrades 1
//           Notes:
//           • The following table behaves differently from the one in the list below.
//           • Once upgraded, the ID/name of the car will change instead. See 0x1abc828 & 0x1abc848.
//           • I'll leave the table reference here since they're related to upgrades:
//           ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//           Original Car    >>>      | Manufacturers  | Upgrade Result
//           ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//           Mercedes-Benz SLK 55 AMG + AMG	           = Mercedes-Benz SLK 55 AMG Performance Package
//           └──────────────────────> + Mercedes-Benz  = Mercedes-Benz SLK B 55 S
//           └────────────> = Mercedes-Benz SLK 6.1 S capacity increase
//           
//           Nissan 350Z Coupe           = Nissan 350Z NISMO S-Tune (can upgrade to R-Tune/Power too)
